<title>USA: Viking gets $1 mln funding commitment.</title>
<headline>Viking gets $1 mln funding commitment.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viking Resources International Inc said on Monday that it received an equity funding commitment for $1 million from a group of private investors.</p>
<p>Terms for the commitment were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said the money would be used to clean up remaining debts and funding future acquisitions.</p>
<p>Viking is a holding company.</p>
</text>
